          "text": "General appearance and examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Looks tired, no acute distress, no obvious pallor or jaundice. No goitre. Cardiovascular, respiratory, abdominal, and neurological examinations grossly unremarkable."
