          "text": "Eye examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild bilateral conjunctival injection, follicles and mild upper tarsal scarring. No obvious trichiasis or entropion; corneas grossly clear; mild mucous at canthi. Visual acuity approximately 6/6 right and 6/9 left, reported by patient as baseline. No photophobia."
      }
    },
